Rejig: reject layouts beyond the iPhone's 15 Home Screen pages before Apply.
The phone's saved reads stop at 15 pages; a requested 20-page layout rolled back.
Keep the editor and MCP draft from adding pages beyond that limit, and enforce it
in the planner and device boundary so imported layouts cannot silently lose apps.
Applies after the other Rejig patches to ios-homescreen at
97649547dbc44295e451c6bf130a87404481e10c. MIT; upstream copyright
(c) 2026 Yakup Emre Yerli (see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md).

